+    <string name="renova_credits_summary">Thanks to the NOVA team and the Archos Video Player Community Edition. Info from TMDb, anime titles from AniList. ReNova is an independent fork.</string>
     <string name="preferences_ambient_mode">Cinema mode</string>
     <string name="preferences_ambient_mode_summary">Soft glow in the colors of the video around the picture instead of black bars (like YouTube\'s ambient mode)</string>
     <string name="data_source_nfo">NFO</string>
